        <div class="tier-title">Passive monitoring</div>
        <div class="tier-freq">Monthly · 15 minutes</div>
        <div class="tier-desc">Set-and-forget Google Scholar alerts and Semantic Scholar email notifications for your key search terms. Review the digest once a month. Flag anything that meets your PECO-F criteria for closer reading.</div>
        <div class="tier-tools">Tools: Google Scholar alerts · Semantic Scholar · Research Rabbit updates</div>
