        <div class="tier-freq">Weekly · 90 minutes</div>
        <div class="tier-desc">Reserved for active policy decisions with a tight timeline — a financing reform under deliberation, a budget submission window, an active HTAIn assessment. Run the full protocol at weekly cadence. Every new finding is immediately assessed against the current brief's conclusions for material impact.</div>
