    <p class="s-subtitle">When the Error Term Travels with the Evidence</p>
    <p class="s-oneliner">Every piece of global evidence carries its own ε, σ, and λ. When you transfer it to India, all three transfer with it — and the question is whether the combined error term makes the finding usable or dangerous.</p>
